- shrub900 - started derive and wayland.fyi, also made neuswc/neuwld
- uint23 - great programmer, made neumenu
- xplshn - a vast amount of patches for neuswc were created by him

Relevant
--------
 
- [neumenu](https://git.sr.ht/~uint/neumenu) - really good fork of a fork
- [st-wl](https://github.com/michaelforney/st) - good (enough) wayland st fork
- [dwc](https://git.sr.ht/~corg/DWC) - dwm-like wayland compositor
- [velox](https://github.com/michaelforney/velox) - simple compositor based on swc

